title FIAP Hackathon — Sequência do happy path

Client [icon: user]
APIGW [icon: aws-api-gateway, label: "API Gateway"]
Authorizer [icon: aws-lambda, label: "Authorizer"]
BFF [icon: nestjs, label: "BFF"]
Upload [icon: nestjs, label: "upload-orchestration"]
ClamAV [icon: shield]
S3 [icon: aws-s3]
RDS [icon: aws-rds, label: "MySQL"]
QReq [icon: aws-sqs, label: "SQS analysis-requested"]
Processing [icon: nestjs, label: "processing"]
Gemini [icon: google, label: "Gemini Vision"]
Groq [icon: brain, label: "Groq Llama"]
Mongo [icon: mongodb]
QComp [icon: aws-sqs, label: "SQS analysis-completed"]
Report [icon: nestjs, label: "report"]

Client > APIGW: POST /api/analyses (file, JWT, Idempotency-Key)
APIGW > Authorizer: validate JWT
Authorizer --> APIGW: isAuthorized=true (sub, scopes)
APIGW > BFF: POST /api/analyses
BFF > Upload: POST /api/analyses (multipart)
Upload > Upload: valida MIME + magic bytes + size
Upload > ClamAV: scan(buffer)
ClamAV --> Upload: clean
Upload > S3: PutObject raw/{uuid}
Upload > RDS: INSERT analyses (RECEIVED)
Upload > QReq: SendMessage analysis.requested
Upload --> BFF: 202 {analysisId, status, receivedAt}
BFF --> APIGW: 202
APIGW --> Client: 202 Accepted

// === assíncrono ===
Processing > QReq: ReceiveMessage
Processing > S3: GetObject
Processing > Gemini: ComponentsExtraction (Zod)
Gemini --> Processing: JSON validado
Processing > Groq: RisksAndRecommendations (Zod)
Groq --> Processing: JSON validado
Processing > Mongo: INSERT analysis_results
Processing > QComp: SendMessage analysis.completed (payload completo)
Processing > QReq: DeleteMessage
Report > QComp: ReceiveMessage
Report > RDS: INSERT reports
Report > QComp: DeleteMessage

// === consulta do relatório ===
Client > APIGW: GET /api/reports/{id}
APIGW > BFF: GET /api/reports/{id}
BFF > Report: GET /api/reports/{id}
Report --> BFF: 200 OK relatório completo
BFF --> APIGW: 200 OK
APIGW --> Client: 200 OK
